    Ordinance No. M-525-98 – Zoning Variation: 653 Blackthorn – Adoption.
Trustee Meuer moved to adopt the ordinance approving the request. He was
seconded by Trustee Derning. By roll call vote, the motion carried unanimously.
Ayes: Trustees Meuer, Hilton, Lien, Duhl, Derning and Lanphier. Nays: None.
Absent: None.
   Ordinance No. M-526-98 – Zoning Variances: 731 Prospect – Adoption. Trustee
Lanphier thanked the applicants for resolving outside of this forum the issues
surrounding the air conditioning units and complimented them on their
preservation efforts. Attorney Janega noted that since this issue had been
resolved, the proposed ordinance should be amended to reflect the withdrawal of
