   Trustee Lanphier then moved to adopt the ordinance permitting the
construction of a dormer, as amended. She was seconded by Trustee Meuer. By
roll call vote, the motion passed unanimously. Ayes: Trustees Lanphier, Duhl,
Hilton, Derning, Lien and Meuer. Nays: None. Absent: None.
