Resolution No. R-19-2000 - Honoring Trustee Duhl for Village Service.
Resolution No. R-18-2000 - Honoring Trustee Hilton for Village Service.
President Holland read aloud the Resolutions honoring Trustees Don Derning,
Michael Duhl and David Hilton for their four years of service as Village
Trustees.
Trustee Lien moved for adoption of Resolution No. R-18-2000. He was seconded by
Trustee Powell. By voice vote, the motion carried unanimously.
Trustee Powell moved for adoption of Resolution No. R-19-2000. He was seconded
by Trustee Lien. By voice vote, the motion carried unanimously.
Trustee Powell moved for adoption of Resolution No. R-20-2000. He was seconded
by Trustee Lien. By voice vote, the motion carried unanimously.
Warrant Lists Nos. 1167 and 1168. Trustee Powell moved to approve Warrant List
No. 1167 in the total amount of $376,577.38 and Warrant List No. 1168 in the
