vote, the motion carried unanimously. Ayes: Trustees Powell, Woodbury, Lien,
Brower, and Presser. Nays: None. Absent: Trustee Aquilino.
XI. Reports
Village Trustees. Trustee Brower, who is a Vice President at Harris Bank
Winnetka, tendered a signed statement, directed to the attention of Village
President Holland, stating that he will abstain from, and not participate in,
discussions or voting at either Harris Bank or at meetings of the Village
