Trustee Presser, seconded by Trustee Aquilino, moved to introduce the ordinance
By voice vote, the motion carried.
d)   Ordinance No. MC-6-2001 – Appearance Review Appeals – Introduction. Ms.
Janega reviewed the draft ordinance amending the appearance review appeal
