Brower seconded the motion. By roll call vote, the motion carried unanimously.
Ayes: Trustees Brower, Greenough, Aquilino, Powell, Presser, and Woodbury.
Nays: None. Absent: None.
b)   Chamber of Commerce Request. Manager Williams reviewed a request from the
