Trustee Brower reported on a recent meeting of the Chamber of Commerce.
b)   Manager. Manager Williams reported that the Winnetka Police Department had
been reaccredited by CALEA. He also reported that the SWANCC balefill project
has finally been concluded and that the Village Yards project is proceeding on
track and somewhat under budget.
11. Appointments.
None.
12. Executive Session.
Trustee Woodbury moved to adjourn into Executive Session for the purpose of
