b)   Policy Direction: 340 Poplar. As noted earlier, this item was removed from
the agenda.
c)   Mirani’s: Outdoor Seating Permit & Sidewalk Restaurant Liquor License
Rider. Attorney Janega reported that Winnetka Food, Inc., d/b/a Mirani’s, has
applied for an outdoor seating permit and outdoor liquor rider license. She
