d)   Bid No. 07-005: Cable Bid: Assistant Director of Water & Electric Rich
Ciesla reported that four of the seven vendors that were issued RFP’s in
connection with primary and secondary cable purchases had submitted bids, with
only two bidding on both the primary and secondary cable. He recommended that
the primary cable bid be awarded to Okonite and the secondary cable bid be
awarded to Resco. In response to a question, Mr. Ciesla replied that the fourth
vendor, Border State, had submitted the highest bid for the 600V cable.
Following discussion about the age of the cables and the price of metals,
Manager Williams indicated that the primary cable project would be on hold
until the cost of the replacement diesel fuel line for the Electric Plant and
its budget impact can be determined, but recommended awarding the bids before
