an amount not to exceed $165,745.00. By roll call vote, the motion carried.
Ayes: Trustees Behles, Berger, Eilers, Poor, Ritchell and Tucker. Nays: None.
Absent: None.
e)   Bid No. 07-004: Transformer Bid: Mr. Ciesla distributed a handout
containing a chart comparing the life cycle cost of single- and three-phase
transformers. He indicated that the Village is reimbursed for the majority of
