Manager Doug Williams, Village Attorney Katherine Janega, Director of Community
Development Michael D’Onofrio, Director of Water & Electric Brian Keys, Public
Works Director ’’Steve Saunders’ and approximately 15 persons in the audience.
10)   Ordinances and Resolutions.
a)   Commendation Resolutions.
   i)   Resolution No. R-24-2008 – Commending Trustee Jessica Tucker. President
Woodbury read aloud a resolution commending Trustee Tucker and thanking her for
her service to the Village. Trustee Behles, seconded by Trustee Berger, moved
to adopt Resolution R-24-2008. By voice vote the motion carried.
      President Woodbury Presented Ms. Tucker with a copy of the Resolution.
   ii)   Resolution No. R-25-2008 – Commending Trustee Herb Ritchell. President
Woodbury read aloud a resolution commending Trustee Ritchell and thanking him
