Public Hearing. President Woodbury opened the public hearing for the purpose of
discussing the relocation of the Winnetka Post Office’s letter carrier annex.
Trustee Poor introduced Brian Schroeder, a real estate specialist with the
USPS, explaining that Federal law requires a public notice any time a post
