endorsing the Greenest Region Compact. He reviewed the program Staff devised to
give away the 3,100 bulbs allotted to Winnetka, and proposed adding a label to
the package describing the Village’s CFL recycling program.
After a brief discussion, the Council approved the CFL distribution as
proposed.
d)   Bid No. 08-005 – Spruce Street–– Reconstruction and Drainage Improvements.
Mr. Saunders reported that nine bids were received for the Spruce Street
Reconstruction and Drainage Improvements project. He indicated that the low
bidder, Chicagoland Paving, performed 2007 MFT road resurfacing to the
