after the tables are placed. By voice vote, the motion carried.
12)   Reports
b)   Village President.
c)   Trustees.
   i)   Trustee Poor reported that on April 28 th he and Trustee Behles met
with the Forestry Commission to discuss the vision of the new Environmental and
Forestry Commission. He observed that the group plans to hear from
environmental committees from other communities to get a sense of how to get up
and running. Trustee Behles added that the Forestry Commission members are very
