President Woodbury called the meeting to order at 7:35 p.m. Present: Trustees
Ken Behles, Sandra Berger, Gene Greable, Bill Johnson, and King Poor. Absent:
Trustee Chris Rintz. Also present: Village Manager Doug Williams, Director of
Public Works Steven Saunders, Assistant Director of Community Development Brian
Norkus, and one person in the audience.
