b)   Resolution No. R-33-2008 – R & B Silverman Subdivision (Consolidation) of
755 Sheridan Road- Adoption. Mr. Norkus reviewed a request to consolidate two
existing parcels of land into a single lot. He explained that the properties to
be consolidated include a vacant flag lot and a lakefront lot with an existing
