agreed.
Trustee Johnson, seconded by Trustee Behles, moved to adopt Resolution No. M-
33-2008. By roll call vote, the motion carried unanimously. Ayes: Trustees
Johnson, Behles, Berger, Poor, and Greable. Nays: None. Absent: Trustee Rintz.
c)   Resolution No. R-34-2008 – Beghou Subdivision: 707 Ardsley/700 Rosewood –
Adoption. Mr. Norkus reviewed a request to reconfigure and resubdivide the two
