   b)   Ordinance No. M-10-2009 – Special Use Permit: ––––1390 Willow Road–– –
Park District Maintenance Bldg. – Introduction/Adoption. Mr. D’Onofrio reviewed
a request from the Park District to construct a new service center for the
parks’ maintenance operations on the lower plateau of the former landfill at
the Village Yards. He reported that the proposed improvements comply with all
zoning bulk, lot coverage, and setback requirements and that the Plan
Commission, Zoning Board of Appeals, and Design Review Board had voted in favor
of recommending approval of the special use permit, but noted that the Plan
Commission’s approval was conditional upon the Park District’s addressing three
