vote, the motion carried unanimously. Ayes: Trustees Greable, Johnson, Spinney,
Rintz, Pedian, and Poor. Nays: None. Absent: None.
   Trustee Johnson, seconded by Trustee Spinney, moved to adopt the ordinance
as amended. By roll call vote, the motion carried unanimously. Ayes: Trustees
Spinney, Rintz, Pedian, Poor, Greable, and Johnson. Nays: None. Absent: None.
