managers, and depository institutions for the Village of Winnetka. By voice
vote, the motion carried unanimously.
9)   Public Comment and Questions.
None.
10)   Old Business.
None.
11)   New Business.
   a)   Warrant Lists 1609 and 1610. Trustee Pedian reported that she had
reviewed Warrant List No. 1609 in the amount of $750,884.44 and Warrant List
No. 1610 in the amount of $612,940.70 and found no discrepancies or areas of
