Insituform Technologies, which has performed numerous lining projects for the
Village in the past.
Trustee Johnson, seconded by Trustee Spinney, moved to award   the bid for
trenchless relining to   the existing sanitary sewer, pursuant to Bid No. 09-
007, to Insituform Technologies in the total amount of $105,579.50. By roll
call vote, the motion carried unanimously. Ayes: Trustees Johnson, Spinney,
Rintz, Pedian, Poor, and Greable. Nays: None. Absent: None.
   c)   Winnetka Cenotaph Restoration – Change Order #1 . Mr. Saunders
explained that when the Village awarded the contract to Sebastian Contracting
Corp., to complete the restoration of the Cenotaph on the Village Green, much
