Trustee Pedian, seconded by Trustee Johnson, moved to authorize Change Order #1
for the Winnetka Cenotaph Restoration in the amount of $41,055.96. By roll call
vote, the motion carried unanimously. Ayes: Trustees Pedian, Poor. Nays: None.
