      i)   July 14, 2009, Study Session.
      ii)    July 21, 2009, Regular Meeting.
      iii)   August 11, 2009, Special Meeting.
   b)   Warrant Lists Nos. 1617 & 1618. Approving Warrant List No. 1617 in the
