   a)   Ordinance No. M-16-2009 – Zoning Variations: 766 Walden – Adoption. Ms.
Janega reviewed the proposed amendments to this Ordinance granting Maximum
Building Size and Side Yard Setback zoning variations at 766 Walden to permit
the construction of a second floor addition. She said the most important new
finding was that the public benefits from the strict application of the
Village’s zoning regulations in this instance would not be sufficient to
outweigh the practical difficulties that it would impose on the Owners,
particularly given the limited functionality of the second floor.
Trustee Spinney, seconded by Trustee Greable, moved to amend the ordinance as
