Trustee Johnson, moved to approve the Agenda, as amended. By roll call vote,
the motion carried. Ayes: Trustees Greable, Spinney, Johnson, Rintz, Pedian,
and Poor. Nays: None. Absent: None.
5)   Consent Agenda
   a)   Village Council Minutes.
      i)   November 17, 2009, Regular Meeting.
      ii)   December 1, 2009, Regular Meeting.
      iii)   December 8, 2009, Special Meeting.
      iv)   December 8, 2009, Study Session.
   b)   Warrant Lists Nos. 1633 and 1634. Approving Warrant List No. 1633 in
the amount of $849,152.11, and Warrant List No. 1634 in the amount of
