   c)   Attorney. None.
   d)   Manager. Manager Williams asked Mr. Keys to report on an announcement
from IMEA. Mr. Keys reported that IMEA had entered into a long term contract
with a producer of wind energy from a wind farm located in Illinois and will
start taking energy in the near future.
Trustee Poor congratulated IMEA on taking this aggressive and positive step
toward the use of renewable energy, and thanked Manager Williams for his vision
and direction in bringing Naperville into IMEA, thereby helping to shift
leadership to the northern communities.
