Pedian, Poor and Spinney. Nays: None. Absent: Trustee Rintz. The Council
adjourned into Executive Session at 8:09 p.m.
The Council reconvened into Regular Session at 10:02 p.m. Present: President
Tucker, Trustees Greable, Johnson, Pedian, Poor, and Spinney. Absent: Trustee
Rintz. Also present: Village Attorney Katherine Janega, Village Manager Doug
