power in Springfield is concentrated in the hands of lobbyists, unions and
certain legislators. He urged people to vote, think about requiring term
limits, and inform their elected representatives of their concerns.
c)   Attorney. Attorney Janega reported on the progress of the restrictive
covenant the Village is requiring of Anitfield as a condition for granting the
special use permit for Coldwell Banker at the Galleria building. She
recommended that the Council extend the 30-day deadline for negotiations, as
the parties are working diligently and are very close to an agreement. The
Council concurred.
d)   Manager. No report.
