Trustee Johnson, seconded by Trustee Spinney, moved to issue the Council’s
written opinion and final order in the form discussed by the Council. By roll
call vote, the motion carried. Ayes: Trustees Poor, Johnson, Spinney, Rintz,
Pedian, and Greable. Nays: None. Absent: None
10)   New Business.
None.
10)   Reports
   a)   Village President. President Tucker announced that the suggestion
