Spinney. Nays: None. Absent: None. The Council adjourned into Executive Session
at 7:52 p.m.
The Council reconvened into Regular Session at 8:30 p.m. Present: President
Tucker, Trustees Greable, Johnson, Pedian, Poor, Rintz and Spinney. Absent:
