   a)   Village President. President Tucker reported that she attended the
Northwest Municipal Conference Legislative Brunch a few weeks ago, adding that
the NWMC Legislative Program is on the Village’s website. She encouraged all to
view it and to contact their elected representatives to express support for
that program. She also reported that she had recently met with State Senator
Schoenberg to discuss current state legislation relating to fiscal solvency and
attended a press conference with Mayor Daley in support of a new gun control
law.
   b)   Trustees.
