1)   Call to Order.
    President Tucker called the meeting to order at 7:36 p.m. Present: Trustees
Gene Greable, Bill Johnson, King Poor, Chris Rintz and Jennifer Spinney.
Absent: Trustee Linda Pedian. Also present: Trustees-elect Arthur Braun and
Richard Kates, Village Manager Robert Bahan, Village Attorney Katherine Janega,
Director of Water & Electric Brian Keys, Public Works Director Steve Saunders,
Community Development Director Mike D’Onofrio, Assistant Director of Community
Development Brian Norkus, Interim Police Chief Pat Kreis, Fire Chief Alan
