   a)   May 10, 2011 Study Session. Trustee Rintz and Trustee-elect Braun
indicated that they would be unable to attend. Trustees Johnson and Spinney
indicated that their availability was uncertain. The other Council members
present indicated that they expected to attend.
   b)   May 17, 2011 Regular Meeting. All of the Council members present
indicated that they expected to attend, except Trustee Rintz and Trustee-elect
Braun.
