      Mr. Pat Livney, 368 and 388 Elder, commented that there is no bigger
legacy than to say that the flooding problem in Winnetka was repaired. He asked
the Council to hold the engineering firm accountable and to put money towards
infrastructure because it benefits every resident.
   b)   Affordable housing update.
      Village Manager Bahan reported that at its April 12 th meeting, the
Council had directed staff to follow up on 3 of the 5 recommendations in the
