   b)   October 11, 2011, Study Session. All of the Council members present,
except Trustee Braun, indicated that they expected to attend.
4)   Approval of the Agenda.
Trustee Braun, seconded by Trustee Johnson, moved to approve the Agenda. By
roll call vote, the motion carried. Ayes: Trustees Braun, Greable, Kates,
Johnson, Spinney and Rintz. Nays: None. Absent: None.
5)   Consent Agenda
   a)   Village Council Minutes.
      i)   July 12, 2011, Study Session
      ii)   August 2, 2011, Regular Meeting
