Braun, indicated that they expected to attend.
   b)   October 18, 2011, Regular Meeting. All of the Council members present
indicated that they expected to attend.
4)   Approval of the Agenda.
Trustee Kates said he would like to highlight Item 5(f), the Pavement
Management System, so the public would be aware of this great example of
intergovernmental cooperation. Trustee Braun, seconded by Trustee Johnson,
moved to approve the Agenda. By roll call vote. the motion carried. Ayes:
Trustees Braun, Greable, Kates, Johnson, and Spinney. Nays: None. Absent:
Trustee Rintz.
