Trustee Rintz expressed his gratitude to his family for their support
throughout his tenure as Trustee, to Staff for their remarkable
professionalism, and to the residents for giving him the opportunity to serve.
He encouraged the incoming Trustees to “do their homework,” keep an open mind,
