Trustee Kates, seconded by Trustee Braun, moved to adopt Resolution R-24-2012
appointing President Tucker and Mr. Bahan SWANCC representatives. By roll call
vote, the motion carried. Ayes: Trustees Braun, Kates, Spinney, Buck, Corrigan,
