President Tucker announced that Item 5(c), Village Council Meeting Schedule,
had been removed from the consent agenda for discussion under New Business.
Trustee Braun, seconded by Trustee Spinney, moved to approve the Agenda as
amended. By roll call vote, the motion carried. Ayes: Trustees Braun, Buck,
Corrigan, Kates, McCrary and Spinney. Nays: None. Absent: None.
