meeting but do not require introduction. There were no questions or comments
from the Council.
      i)   Resolution R-8-2013: Village Budget – Adoption.
         Trustee Kates, seconded by Trustee Braun, moved to adopt Resolution R-
8-2013. By roll call vote, the motion carried. Ayes: Trustees Braun, Buck,
