Trustee Braun. Also present: Village Manager Rob Bahan, Village Attorney
Katherine Janega, and Assistant to the Village Manager Megan Pierce.
14)   Adjournment.
Trustee Buck, seconded by Trustee Kates, moved to adjourn the meeting. By voice
vote, the motion carried. The meeting adjourned at 9:55 p.m.
      
