1)   Call to Order.
President Greable called the meeting to order at 7:02 p.m. Present: Trustees
Joe Adams, Arthur Braun, Jack Buck, Richard Kates, and Stuart McCrary. Absent:
Trustee Patrick Corrigan (arrived at 7:15 p.m.). Also present: Village Manager
Robert Bahan, Village Attorney Katherine Janega, Assistant to the Village
