R-35-2013. By roll call vote, the motion carried. Ayes: Trustees Adams, Braun,
Buck, Corrigan, Kates and McCrary. Nays: None. Absent: None.
      vi)   Resolution R-36-2013: General Permit & License Fees – Adoption.
