None.
11)   Appointments.
   a)   Trustee Braun, seconded by Trustee Buck, moved to appoint Steven
Scherer to the Environmental & Forestry Commission for a full term, effective
immediately.
12)   Reports.
   a)   Village President. No report.
   b)   Trustees.
