Joe Adams, Patrick Corrigan, Richard Kates, and Stuart McCrary. Absent:
Trustees Arthur Braun and Jack Buck. Also present: Village Manager Robert
Bahan, Assistant to the Village Manager Megan Pierce, Village Attorney
Katherine Janega, Finance Director Ed McKee, Director of Public Works Steve
Saunders, Fire Chief Alan Berkowsky, Deputy Fire Chief John Ripka, Fire Support
Specialist Nick Mostardo, and approximately 10 persons in the audience.
