   a)   March 11, 2014 Study Session. All of the Council members present
indicated that they expected to attend.
   b)   March 20, 2014 Rescheduled Regular Meeting. All of the Council members
present indicated that they expected to attend.
   c)   April 1, 2014 Regular Meeting. All of the Council members present
indicated that they expected to attend.
