   c)   President Greable announced the appointment of Christopher Enck to a
full term on the Landmark Preservation Commission, effective immediately.
Trustee Fessler, seconded by Trustee Krucks, moved to approve the appointment.
By voice vote, the motion carried.
12)   Reports.
   a)   Village President. No report.
   b)   Trustees.
      i)   Trustee Krucks reported on the June 2 Landmark Preservation
Commission meeting, and announced that the 2014 Landmark Preservation Awards
would be presented on June 22.
      ii)   Trustee Kates reported on the May 28 Plan Commission meeting, and
announced that a special meeting was being held on Wednesday, June 4, to garner
