Trustee Braun, seconded by Trustee Fessler, moved to adopt Resolution R-20-
2014. By voice vote, the motion carried.
   d)   Resolution R-21-2014: Appointing New Village Attorney – Adoption.
President Greable announced that his choice for Winnetka’s new Village Attorney
is Peter M. Friedman of Holland & Knight, LLP, with the approval of the
Trustees. He explained that Holland & Knight has over 50 years’ experience
