President Greable led the group in the Pledge of Allegiance.
3)   Quorum.
   a)   May 12, 2015 Study Session. All of the Council members present
indicated that they expected to attend.
   b)   May 19, 2015 Regular Meeting. All of the Council members present
indicated that they expected to attend.
   c)   June 2, 2015 Regular Meeting. All of the Council members present
indicated that they expected to attend.
4)   Approval of the Agenda.
