      ii)   April 21, 2015 Regular Meeting.
   b)   Warrant List. Approving the Warrant List dated April 17 to 30, 2015 in
the amount of $562,157.99.
   c)   Ordinance No. M-10-2015: 1050 Spruce Street, Variations for the
Construction and Use of a New Detached Garage – Adoption. An Ordinance granting
