Construction and Use of a Pool-Waiver of Introduction & Adoption.
   Community Development Director Mike D'Onofrio addressed the Council giving
the history of the request for variation. Because the subject lot is bound by
streets on three sides, the easement is defined as a private street and
therefore requires a front yard setback. Having addressed the matter at two
previous meetings, the variation was recommended for waiver of introduction and
