concerning bicycle traffic. He reported that 'sharrows', arrows painted on the
road in bike lanes, will be added to the bike plan to improve cyclist
visibility. He also noted he attended the last concert at Hubbard Woods gazebo
prior to demolition for the upcoming park improvements.
   Trustee Fessler noted the Plan Commission convened in July to continue the
discussion on One Winnetka and she was impressed by the interest and comments
of those in attendance.
   c)   Attorney. None.
   d)   Manager. None.
13)   Executive Session.
None
14)   Adjournment.
Trustee Fessler, seconded by Trustee Prodromos, moved to adjourn the meeting.
By voice vote, the motion carried. The meeting adjourned at 8:21 p.m.
