Director Brian Keys, Public Works Director Steve Saunders, and approximately 15
persons in the audience.
President Greable congratulated the newly elected trustees Kristin Ziv, Chris
Rintz and Penny Lanphier, adding that he looks forward to working with them.
President Greable also acknowledged outgoing Trustees Fessler and Prodromos as
outstanding professionals who will hopefully stay involved with the community.
