President Greable led the group in the Pledge of Allegiance.
3)   Quorum.
   a)   April 5, 2016 Regular Meeting. All of the Council members present
indicated they expect to attend.
   b)   April 12, 2016 Study Session. President Greable announced the April 12
Study Session has been cancelled; the final Strand Stormwater Alternatives
Study workshop will be held in its place. Village Manager Robert Bahan noted
the workshop starts at 7:00 p.m. at Washburn School Theater.
   c)   April 19, 2016 Regular Meeting. All of the Council members present
indicated they expect to attend.
