   a)   Village Council Minutes.
      i)   December 6, 2016 Regular Meeting.
   b)   Warrant List. Approving the Warrant List dated December 2 – 15, 2016 in
the amount of $1,296,659.99.
   c)   Resolution No. R-63-2016: GIS Service Provider Agreement (Adoption). A
Resolution approving a service agreement for GIS services with Municipal GIS
