   e)   Resolution No. R-65-2016: Approving Additional Funding Authorizations
and Change Order with B-Max Inc. for Electric Distribution System Work
(Adoption). A Resolution approving additional funding authorizations and change
order #1 to the Village’s contract with B-Max Inc.
   f)   Resolution No. R-66-2016: Approving a Change Order to the Agreement
with Burns & McDonnell Engineering Company for the Development of a Water Main
Replacement Plan (Adoption). A Resolution approving change order #1 to the
Village’s agreement with Burns & McDonnell Engineering Company Inc.
   g)   Resolutions No. R-67-2016 and No. R-68-2016: Establishing Department
Head & Manager Salaries (Adoption). Resolutions approving and establishing the
