Kristin Ziv. Absent: Trustee Penfield Lanphier. Also present: Village Manager
Robert Bahan, Assistant Village Manager Megan Pierce, Village Attorney Peter M.
Friedman, Director of Public Works Steven Saunders, Director of Water &
Electric Brian Keys, Director of Community Development Michael D’Onofrio,
Assistant Director of Community Development Brian Norkus, Deputy Police Chief
Marc Hornstein, Economic Development Coordinator Michael Martella, and four
persons in the audience.
