   a)   Village Council Minutes.
      i)   February 14, 2017 Study Session.
      ii)   February 21, 2017 Regular Meeting.
   b)   Warrant List. Approving the Warrant List dated February 17 – March 2,
2017 in the amount of $624,517.30.
   c)   Resolution No. R-17-2017: 2017 Parkway Tree Planting Contract Extension
(Adoption). Approval of a Resolution to waive bidding and award Purchase Orders
to St. Aubin Nursery and Acres Group for purchase and placement of parkway
trees.
   d)   Resolution No. R-18-2017: Purchase of Utility Truck Replacement
(Adoption). Approval of a Resolution awarding a Purchase Order to Transchicago
