Consent Agenda
Village Council Minutes.
July 11, 2018 Regular Meeting and Study Session.
July 18, 2017 Regular Meeting.
Warrant List. Approving the Warrant List dated July 14-27, 2017 in the amount
of $1,056,427.46.
Motion to Approve Professional Services Agreement with Ehlers & Associates for
Phase II & III Tax Increment Financing Consulting Services. Approval for
consulting services with Ehlers & Associates in a not-to-exceed amount of
$21,500 for Tax Increment Financing consulting services.
