Pat Balsamo, 1037 Cherry Street. Ms. Balsamo commended the Village’s quarterly
print newsletter, the Winnetka Report, and added that the editor should have
their name on the newsletter, along with the contact information for the
Village Manager and Assistant Village Manager.
Reports:
Trustees.  
Trustee Swierk said he participated in the Winnetka Park District’s Superhero
