Trustee Lanphier, seconded by Trustee Ziv, moved to re-appoint Rosann Park-
Jones to the Environmental & Forestry Commission for another full term. By
voice vote, the motion carried.
Trustee Myers, seconded by Trustee Lanphier, moved to re-appoint John Golan to
the Plan Commission for another full term. By voice vote, the motion carried.
Trustee Dearborn, seconded by Trustee Myers, moved to re-appoint Wes Baumann to
the Board of Fire & Police Commissioners for another full term. By voice vote,
the motion carried.
