Trustee Myers, seconded by Trustee Cripe, moved to adopt Ordinance No.
M-12-2017. By roll call vote, the motion carried. Ayes: Trustees Cripe,
Dearborn, Lanphier, Myers, Swierk, and Ziv. Nays: None. Absent: None.
