Village Green on September 10.
Attorney. None.
Manager. None.
Village President.
President Rintz asked the Council to check their calendars for a date to do a
full day of budget meetings in October, as it makes sense to have the
discussions in one session. Next, he asked the Council if it was in favor of
directing the Village Attorney to write an ordinance dealing with art on the
public sidewalks; the Trustees all indicated that they were.
