Quorum.
October 9, 2018 Study Session. All of the Council members present, with the
possible exception of Trustee Wedner, said they expect to attend.
October 16, 2018 Regular Meeting. All of the Council members present said they
expect to attend.
October 26, 2018 Budget Meeting. All of the Council members present, with the
exception of Trustee Myers, said they expect to attend.
Public Comment.
None.
Reports:
Trustees.
Trustee Cripe reported that he is continuing to work with the Village’s sister
agencies on stormwater agreements.
Attorney. None.
Manager. None.
Village President. None.
[Trustee Lanphier arrived at 7:05 PM]
Approval of the Agenda.
