voice vote, the motion carried.
Consent Agenda
Village Council Minutes.
September 4, 2018 Regular Meeting.
September 13, 2018 Study Session.
Approval of Warrant Lists dated August 31 - September 13, 2018 and September
14-27, 2018 in the amount of $1,450,836.11.
Resolution No. R-54-2018: Approving an Easement Agreement for Electrical
Utilities Installation and Maintenance at 123 Fuller Lane (Adoption).
Resolution No. R-55-2018: Approving Extending an Agreement with HeplerBroom
for Legal Services (Adoption).
Resolution No. R-56-2018: District 203 Reciprocal Reporting Agreement
(Adoption).
Resolution No. R-59-2018: Approving an IGA with the City of Evanston for use of
the Winnetka Training Tower (Adoption).
Resolution No. R-60-2018: Establishing an Administrative Procedure to Determine
