Ordinance No. M-13-2018: An Ordinance Granting Final Approval of a Planned
Development - One Winnetka (Introduction).
Trustee Wedner, seconded by Trustee Swierk, moved to introduce Ordinance No. M-
13-2018, with the following amendments: (i) that the Developer work with the
Hadley Institute to address concerns raised in an October 2, 2018 letter from
JLL, including listing Hadley as an additional insured on the general
contractor’s insurance certificate, and appropriate items from the letter be
incorporated into the approval documents; (ii) that the balcony edges are
treated with cast stone or limestone; (iii) references to “other materials” be
stricken from the development agreement; (iv) the east elevation’s exposed wall
be clad in limestone, cast stone, or masonry; and composition of those
materials be subject to approval of the Design Review Board (DRB); (iv) all
