7)   Consent Agenda
   a)   Village Council Minutes.
      i)   November 20, 2018 Regular Meeting.
      ii)   December 4, 2018 Regular Meeting.
   b)   Approval of Warrant List dated November 30 – December 13, 2018 in the
amount of $1,491,898.84.
   c)   Resolution No. R-79-2018: Purchase of Pickup Truck Replacement
