MINUTES
WINNETKA VILLAGE COUNCIL
REGULAR MEETING
(Approved: February 19, 2019)
A record of a legally convened regular meeting of the Council of the Village of
Winnetka, which was held in the Village Hall Council Chambers on Tuesday,
February 5, 2019, at 7:00p.m.
1)   Call to Order.
President Rintz called the meeting to order at 7:01 p.m. Present: Trustees
Andrew Cripe, Robert Dearborn, Penfield Lanphier, and John Swierk. Absent:
Trustees Scott Myers and Anne Wedner. Also present: Village Manager Robert
Bahan, Assistant Village Manager Megan Pierce, Village Attorney Peter Friedman,
Community Development Director David Schoon, Director of Water & Electric Brian
Keys, Police Chief Marc Hornstein, and approximately 3 persons in the audience.
