pursuant to Sections 2c(6) and 2c(11) of the Illinois Open Meetings Act.
Trustee Lanphier seconded the motion. By roll call vote, the motion carried.
Ayes: Trustees Cripe, Dearborn, Lanphier, and Swierk. Nays: None. Absent:
Trustees Myers and Wedner.
President Rintz announced that the Council would not return to the open meeting
after Executive Session. The Council adjourned into Executive Session at 7:42
p.m.
13)   Adjournment.
Trustee Lanphier, seconded by Trustee Dearborn, moved to adjourn the meeting.
By voice vote, the motion carried. The meeting adjourned at 8:42p.m.
 
