Trustee Cripe, seconded by Trustee Lanphier, moved to adopt Ordinance No. M-6-
2019. By roll call vote, the motion carried. Ayes: Trustees Cripe, Dearborn,
Lanphier, Myers, Swierk, and Wedner. Nays: None. Absent: None.
Old Business.
2019 Streetscape Project: 90% Plans and Bid Authorization. Mr. Saunders
explained that the cost estimate for this project is within the Village’s
budgeted amount, although the actual costs won’t be known until bids are
opened.
Jodi Mariano, Teska Associates. Ms. Mariano reviewed the planning process and
gave an overview of the Phase I project.
Dwayne O’Laughlin, Ciorba Group. Mr. O’Laughlin reviewed the construction
phasing, which will be divided into segments to minimize impacts on businesses.
He said there was positive feedback expressed, as well as concerns raised, at
