Ron White, Berkeley Avenue. Mr. White asked about the status of a home under
renovation on the corner of Cherry Street and Hibbard Road. Mr. Schoon
explained that the project had changed from major renovation to a new home
construction, which involves approval from FEMA. The homeowner is expected to
