October 1, 2019 Regular Meeting. All of the Council members present except
Trustee Dearborn said they expect to attend.
Thursday, October 10, 2019 Study Session. All of the Council members present
said they expect to attend.
October 15, 2019 Regular Meeting. All of the Council members present except
Trustee Wedner said they expect to attend.
