[Trustee Lanphier arrived at 7:04 p.m.]
Louise Holland, 545 Oak Street. Ms. Holland thanked the Council on behalf of
the Landmark Preservation Commission.
Jessica Tucker, Locust Street. Ms. Tucker thanked the Council for its continued
support of the 9/11 flag commemoration.
