President Rintz called the meeting to order at 7:04 p.m. Present: Trustees Jack
Coladarci, Andrew Cripe, Robert Dearborn, Penfield Lanphier, John Swierk, and
Anne Wedner. Absent: None. Also present: Village Manager Robert Bahan, Village
Attorney Peter Friedman, Public Works Director Steve Saunders, Finance Director
