items on the Consent Agenda by omnibus vote. By roll call vote, the motion
carried. Ayes: Trustees Apatoff, Dearborn, Lanphier, Mancini, and Swierk. Nays:
None. Absent: Trustee Cripe.
8)   Ordinances and Resolutions.
   a)   Ordinance No. M-12-2021: Amendment to Special Use Permit & Variations -
New Trier High School, 385 Winnetka Avenue (Introduction/Adoption).
   Trustee Dearborn, seconded by Trustee Swierk, moved to waive introduction of
