1)   Call to Order.
President Rintz called the meeting to order at 7:02 PM. Present: Trustees
Robert Apatoff, Andrew Cripe, Robert Dearborn, Kim Mancini, and John Swierk.
Absent: None. Also present: Village Manager Robert Bahan, Assistant Village
Manager Kristin Kazenas, Village Attorney Peter Friedman, and approximately 12
persons in the audience.
