A record of a legally convened regular meeting of the Council of the Village of
Winnetka, which was held in the Village Hall Council Chambers on Tuesday,
November 9, 2021, at 7:00 PM.
1)   Call to Order.
President Rintz called the meeting to order at 7:02 PM. Manager Bahan called
the roll of the Village Council. Present: Trustees Rob Apatoff, Andrew Cripe,
Tina Dalman, Bob Dearborn, Kim Mancini and John Swierk. Absent: None. Also
present: Village Manager Robert Bahan, Assistant Village Manager Kristin
Kazenas, Village Attorney Peter Friedman and one person in the audience.
2)   Public Comment. None.
