(Introduction).
      Trustee Cripe, seconded by Trustee Apatoff, moved to introduce Ordinance
No. M-21-2021. By roll call vote, the motion carried. Ayes: Trustees Apatoff,
Cripe, Dalman, Dearborn, and Mancini. Nays: None. Absent: Trustee Swierk.
      iii)   Ordinance No. M-22-2021: Tax Abatement Ordinance for General
Obligation Refunding Bonds, Series 2020 (Introduction).
      Trustee Dalman, seconded by Trustee Cripe, moved to introduce Ordinance
No. M-22-2021. By roll call vote, the motion carried. Ayes: Trustees Apatoff,
Cripe, Dalman, Dearborn, and Mancini. Nays: None. Absent: Trustee Swierk.
9)   Old Business. None.
10)   New Business. None.
