Trustee Dalman, seconded by Trustee Apatoff, moved to appoint Chris Foley to
the Plan Commission to fill a vacancy for Jay Vanderlaan. His term will expire
on 5/18/2024. By roll call vote, the motion carried. Ayes: Trustees Apatoff,
Cripe, Dalman, Dearborn, Mancini, and Swierk. Nays: None. Absent: None.
Closed Session for the Purpose of Discussing Collective Bargaining Pursuant to
