Resolution No. R-62-2022 – Approving a Contract with Wesco Distribution, Inc.
for the Purchase of Single Phase Pad Mount Transformers (Adoption)
Resolution No. R-63-2022 – Approving a Contract with Wesco Distribution, Inc.
for the Purchase of Single Phase Pole Mount Transformers (Adoption)
