called the roll. Present: Trustees Robert Apatoff, Tina Dalman, Robert
Dearborn, and John Swierk Absent: Trustee Andy Cripe. Also present: Assistant
Village Manager Kristin Kazenas, Village Attorney Peter Friedman, Deputy
