roll call vote, the motion carried. Ayes: Trustees Apatoff, Dalman, Dearborn,
Handler, and Swierk. Nays: None. Absent: Trustee Cripe.
The Council adjourned into Closed Session at 9:02 p.m.
17)   Adjournment.
The Closed Session meeting ended at 9:35 p.m.
 
