A record of a legally convened regular meeting of the Council of the Village of
Winnetka, which was held at Council Chambers on Tuesday, August 16, 2022, at 7:
00 PM.
1)   Call to Order.
President Christopher Rintz called the meeting to order at 7:00 PM. Village
Manager Rob Bahan called the roll. Present: Trustees Rob Apatoff, Andy Cripe,
Tina Dalman, Bob Dearborn, Kim Handler, and John Swierk. Absent: None. Also
present: Assistant Village Manager Kristin Kazenas, Deputy Village Clerk Berina
Gradjan, Engineering Director Jim Bernahl, Assistant Water and Electric
Director Nick Narhi, Deputy Police Chief Brian O’Connell, Village Attorney
Peter Friedman, and approximately 17 persons in the audience.
